### Registro de usuario admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Admin Test",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "dni": 12345678,
  "rol": "ADMINISTRADOR"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": 12345678,
  "password": "123456"
}

### Reclamos sin filtro
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reclamos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3OCIsInJvbCI6IkFETUlOSVNUUkFET1IiLCJub21icmUiOiJBZG1pbiBUZXN0IiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4MzAzOTk5LCJleHAiOjE3ODgzOTAzOTl9.gbtM9zyyUd-TtU9mb16NnwMUq3rZhDbY-Iq8OgwAee4


